  "id": "dynamical/ecmwf-ifs-grib",
  "title": "ECMWF IFS ENS Weather Model Historical Archive",
  "description": "Archive of ECMWF IFS ENS (Integrated Forecasting System Ensemble) weather forecast data in GRIB Edition 1 format at 0.25-degree global resolution. Covers approximately 2,946 forecast dates from 2016-03-08 through 2024-04-01, with 51 ensemble members (1 control + 50 perturbed), surface and pressure-level variables at 3-hourly and 6-hourly steps out to 360 hours. Sourced from ECMWF's MARS tape archive to bridge the gap before ECMWF's public open-data S3 archive begins.",
